# Imodane, the Pyrohammer: "that much damage" (CR 120.3, 120.8): damage of 0 is not dealt, so it triggers nothing, and 1 is passed on
# as 1. Turn 3: Fireball with X = 0 at Bot2's Ornithopter (a spell that targets only a single creature) deals it nothing and
# Bot2 stays at 20. Turn 5: X = 1 at the same Ornithopter deals it 1 and Imodane deals Bot2 1 (20 -> 19).

